{'symbol': 'EL', 'date': '2021-05-11 07:00:00', 'title': 'THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES APPOINTS MERIDITH WEBSTER AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS AND PUBLIC AFFAIRS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES INC. (NYSE:EL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MERIDITH WEBSTER WILL JOIN THE COMPANY IN THE NEWLY-CREATED ROLE OF EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS AND PUBLIC AFFAIRS, EFFECTIVE MAY 17, 2021. MERIDITH WILL REPORT JOINTLY TO WILLIAM P. LAUDER, EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN, AND FABRIZIO FREDA, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. SHE WILL ALSO JOIN THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES INC.'S (“ELC”) EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM. MERIDITH WILL SUCCEED ALEXANDRA"}